span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a>, at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-565&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-355</span> (near the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/25px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/38px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/50px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/25px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\">Phase Spider Matriarch</a>)</li>\n<li>On a desk at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1504&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-125</span> in the basement of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Philgrave%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Philgrave's Mansion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Philgrave's Mansion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Philgrave%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Philgrave's Mansion\">Philgrave's Mansion</a> in Act Three (if missed in the Whispering Depths)</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item can be used to unlock the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy_of_Thay\" title=\"Necromancy of Thay\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy_of_Thay\" title=\"Necromancy of Thay\">Necromancy of Thay</a>. Using the book with the Dark Amethyst grants an option to insert it into the oval recess as part of the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unlock_the_Ancient_Tome\" title=\"Unlock the Ancient Tome\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unlock the Ancient Tome\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Unlock_the_Ancient_Tome\" title=\"Unlock the Ancient Tome\">Unlock the Ancient Tome</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195235\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2459/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33953/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9252/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1103746/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   55.898      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   55.898      1 -total\n 43.43%   24.275      9 Template:Icon_text\n 39.35%   21.997     28 Template:Trim\n 17.71%    9.897      2 Template:Uid\n 16.68%    9.322      5 Template:Icon_link\n 14.61%    8.169      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 14.33%    8.008      1 Template:Main_only\n 10.54%    5.894      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.43%    5.832      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4186-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195235 and revision id 387123. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}